---
source: crates/beck-cli/tests/ui.rs
expression: "render(&edited(\"@on(server)\\nproposals\", \"@on(client)\\nproposals\"))"
---
error[B0401]: `proposals` is placed on `client`, which cannot discharge `ingress`
  --> t.beck:131:2
    |
131 | @on(client)
    |  ^^^^^^^^^^ `client` cannot do this
    |
  --> t.beck:132:1
    |
132 | proposals: Stream[Proposal] = merge_clients()
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the definition it is placed on
    |
  = note: `ingress` is the merge point: it admits time and nondeterminism, and only the server holds it
  = help: `@on(server)` discharges everything this needs
